  <name>ProCraft</name>
  <summary>Paint and draw with brushes, layers and animation</summary>
  <description>
    <p>ProCraft is a painting app with pressure-sensitive brushes, layers, colour adjustments, selection and transform tools. It also includes animation and 3D painting features.</p>
